ed_at":"2026-10-18T04:01:40+00:00"},{"id":"EST-202610-044","type":"estimation","date":"2026-10-17","customer_type":"client","sale_unit_mode":"sqft","bill_to":{"name":"Excellent Innovative Equipments Pvt Ltd","address":"No.8 Sherine Nagar, Rediyarpatti Road near govt Engg college, TIRUNELVELI -  627 007","gstin":"33AADCE2747C1Z4","state":"Tamil Nadu","phone":"9840079261","whatsapp":"9840079261","country":"India"},"ship_to":{"show_on_doc":0,"same_as_bill":0,"name":"","address":"","phone":"","state":"","country":"India"},"items":[{"description":"Drainage\r\nConstruction of open saucer drain\r\nOpen saucer drain of width (6 inches x 24 inches) or (9 inches x 24 inches). The height of drain will be made to match the side of the court. This drain will channelize water till one corner of the court. From their drainage connection to be provided by client.","hsn":"9954","qty":120,"unit":"RFT","rate":450,"amount":54000,"specs":["Open saucer drain width: (6 inches x 24 inches) or (9 inches x 24 inches)","The height of drain will be made to match the side of the court","Channelizes water till one corner of the court","Drainage connection from corner to be provided by client"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Sub base\r\nAsphalt\r\nAsphalt Subbase Construction:\r\n*Layer of up to 4\" (100mm) Compacted WMM using Stone Size 40 MM to 60 MM and Compaction of same in One Layer\r\n*Cleaning of Sub base (Wire Brushing) before starting Asphalting Layers\r\n*Tack/Primer Coat to be applied before BM & AC Layers (Qty Consumption will have Tack Coat of Up to 3kg Per 10 Sq. Meter)\r\n*Bituminous Layer of compacted thickness of up to 30 mm using mix of 20 and 10 MM Stone with 80-100/60-70 Grade Bitumen(Subject to availability). Bituminous binder percentage upto3.5%.\r\n*Compacting thickness of AC of up to 20 mm using 6mm Stone with 80-100/60-70 Grade Bitumen( Subject to availability). Bituminous binder percentage up to 3.5-4%.\r\n*Final Layer of Seal Coat using Stone Dust with Bitumen to make the surface appropriate for Synthetic Installation\r\n*If a hot mix plant is being brought to the site, path, location and barrication should be provided by client, keeping in mind the atmospheric and environmental factors.","hsn":"9954","qty":7200,"unit":"SQFT","rate":95,"amount":684000,"specs":["Layer of up to 4\" (100mm) Compacted WMM using Stone Size 40 MM to 60 MM (One Layer)","Cleaning of Sub base (Wire Brushing) before starting Asphalting Layers","Tack/Primer Coat applied before BM & AC Layers (up to 3kg per 10 Sq. Meter)","Bituminous Layer of compacted thickness up to 30 mm (20 & 10 MM Stone, 3.5% binder)","Compacting thickness of AC up to 20 mm (6mm Stone, 3.5-4% Bituminous binder)","Final Layer of Seal Coat using Stone Dust with Bitumen for synthetic installation"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Fabrication\r\nFabrication of 15 feet height\r\nFencing Height: 15 ft overall height\r\nVertical Posts: 72 × 72 mm MS square pipes with 3 mm wall thickness.\r\nHorizontal Members: 50 × 50 mm MS square pipes with 2 mm wall thickness.\r\nPost Spacing: 10 ft centre-to-centre with Top, Centre & Bottom horizontal supports.\r\nInstallation: Vertical posts embedded 2 ft in ground or fixed on base plate with anchor fasteners.\r\nFinish: Primer and Enamel Paint in Bus Green colour.","hsn":"9954","qty":5400,"unit":"SQFT","rate":95,"amount":513000,"specs":["Fencing Height: 15 ft overall height (Total Area: 5,400 Sqft)","Vertical Posts: 72 × 72 mm MS square pipes with 3 mm wall thickness","Horizontal Members: 50 × 50 mm MS square pipes with 2 mm wall thickness","Post Spacing: 10 ft centre-to-centre with Top, Centre & Bottom horizontal supports","Installation: Vertical posts embedded 2 ft in ground or fixed on base plate with anchor fasteners","Finish: Primer and Enamel Paint in Bus Green colour"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Nylon Net\r\nNet\r\nRUSSEA™ High-Tenacity Green Net 2.5mm thick- 40mm box size (Russea™/Tuff equivalent & exceeding specifications). Netting to be done on all four sides, provided to minimize the ball from escaping outside of the net","hsn":"5608","qty":5824,"unit":"SQFT","rate":22,"amount":128128,"specs":["RUSSEA™ High-Tenacity Green Net 2.5mm thick - 40mm box size","Russea™/Tuff equivalent & exceeding specifications","Netting installed on all four sides (5,824 Sqft total area)","UV-stabilized impact containment netting"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Acrylic sports flooring\r\nAcrylic 8 layer - Synthetic sports flooring\r\nAcrylic courts give the necessary speed, texture, and vibrant colors. Acrylic Coating Systems are multi-layer latex based paint systems that establish or restore surface texture, protect underlying asphalt systems from the weather and climatic change, enhance overall playability by establishing play speed and ultimately provide the surface with a vibrant color scheme.\r\n\r\n8 Layer System :- (1 layer of primer + 1 layer of resurfacer + 3 layers of liquid rubber + 1 layer of resurfacer + 1 layers of Acrylic pre coats + 1 acrylic top coat which is blended with UV granules and Silica sand + Line marking )\r\n\r\nProduct Specification\r\n• High density for improved strength.\r\n• Environment friendly.","hsn":"9954","qty":7200,"unit":"SQFT","rate":85,"amount":612000,"specs":["Court Surface Area: 120 FT × 60 FT = 7,200 Sqft","8 Layer System: 1 primer + 1 resurfacer + 3 liquid rubber + 1 resurfacer + 1 acrylic pre-coats + 1 acrylic top coat with UV granules & silica sand + Line marking","High density formulation for improved strength & play speed control","Environment friendly latex-based all-weather coating system"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Tennis / Badminton Net & Posts\r\nFixed MS Posts with internal tension ratchet & professional tournament net\r\n- Fixed Post Made of 80mm x 80mm heavy MS pipe\r\n- With special internal ratchet system for tightening of rope\r\n- Enables perfect tension control of the net\r\n- With branded professional quality net and red weighted protective base sleeves.","