ity, topped with 25mm leveled stone dust screening layer, slope 1:150 for sub-surface rainwater percolation under artificial turf.","hsn":"9954","qty":9600,"unit":"SQFT","rate":55,"amount":528000,"specs":["Court Area: 120ft x 80ft = 9,600 SFT (Rectangular)","Specification: 100mm (4\") WMM compacted with 8-10 ton roller + 25mm stone dust / M-sand blinding layer","Foundation: 26 concrete footings (1.5' x 1.5' x 3' deep)"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Perimeter Drainage System\r\nEngineered perimeter trench drainage along boundary for surface storm water runoff and subgrade protection.","hsn":"9954","qty":400,"unit":"RFT","rate":85,"amount":34000,"specs":["Total Perimeter: 400 Running Feet"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Structural MS/GI Columns & Horizontal Tie Framework\r\nTwo-lines structural ladder column featuring dual uprights with welded ladder rungs @ 1.5ft c/c for climbing access, light fixture maintenance, and high lateral wind resistance.","hsn":"7308","qty":26,"unit":"NOS","rate":26287.69,"amount":683479.94,"specs":["Vertical Columns: 26 Nos - Two-Lines Ladder Type Column (40mm × 40mm Square Pipe, 2.0mm (14G))","Column Upright Specification: 2.0mm Wall Thickness (14 Gauge) (25 FT Clear Height)","Horizontal Tie Framework: 4 tiers on enclosed sides (1600 RFT, 80 pipes of 20ft, 14 Gauge)","Bay Spacing: ~15ft c/c along practice lane","Ladder Rungs: 416 Nos welded steps/bracing (2.0mm (14G)) spaced @ 1.5ft c/c for climbing inspection & wind rigidity","Overhead Net Support: High-tension wire rope cable suspension grid (Zero rigid top steel)"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Perimeter Side & Back Ball-Stop Netting System (2.5mm Braided HDPE (45mm Mesh - Recommended Standard))\r\n2.5mm UV-stabilized high-tenacity HDPE braided netting (45mm square mesh) with heavy 8mm reinforced perimeter border ropes, reinforced 8mm border ropes, 6mm PVC coated wire rope grid.","hsn":"5608","qty":10500,"unit":"SQFT","rate":13.5,"amount":141750,"specs":["Enclosed Net Area: 400 RFT x 25 FT = 10500 SFT (3 sides, incl. overlap)","Net Specification: 2.5mm UV-Stabilized High-Tenacity Braided HDPE (45mm Square Mesh)","Tension Wire Rope: 2600 RFT galvanized wire with turnbuckles & clamps"],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Overhead Roof / Top Netting System\r\nOverhead Roof Netting (1.5mm Twisted HDPE (35mm Mesh / 24-Ply - Recommended Light)): 1.5mm UV-Treated Lightweight High-Tenacity Twisted HDPE (35mm Square Mesh), 1.5mm lightweight twisted HDPE top netting (35mm mesh) designed for minimal sag on wire cable grids supported on wire rope tension grid (no top steel)","hsn":"5608","qty":10368,"unit":"SQFT","rate":8,"amount":82944,"specs":["Top Enclosure Area: 10368 SFT","Specification: 1.5mm UV-Treated Lightweight High-Tenacity Twisted HDPE, 35mm Square Mesh","Support: Wire Rope Tension Grid (No Top Steel)"],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"15mm Curled Multisport Pitch Turf (Full Roll 6.5' × 82' [2M × 25M])\r\nDedicated high-density curled wicket turf strip with 3 FT structure safety offset.","hsn":"5703","qty":540,"unit":"SQFT","rate":78,"amount":42120,"specs":["Roll Specification: Full Roll (6.5 FT × 82 FT = 540 SFT [2.0M × 25.0M = 50 SQM])","Installed Pitch Dimensions: 6.5 FT × 82 FT = 533 SFT laid at center","End Clearances: 3.0 FT clear setback from front & back frame structures"],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Cricket Pitch Turf Specialized Installation & Seaming\r\nSub-base laser leveling, dual-edge high-tensile tape bonding with PU adhesive.","hsn":"9954","qty":533,"unit":"SQFT","rate":9,"amount":4797,"specs":["Installation Scope: Precision center alignment of 533 SFT (82 FT length)","Bonding: Heavy-duty 350 GSM seam joint tape + all-weather PU adhesive"],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Outfield Sports Flooring / Surface (40mm Landscape Sports Grass)\r\nSuper-dense 40mm premium landscape grass providing ultra-soft underfoot cushioning, superior resilience, and vibrant aesthetic appeal.","hsn":"3918","qty":9067,"unit":"SQFT","rate":45,"amount":408015,"