":85,"amount":306000,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Structural MS/GI Columns & Horizontal Tie Framework (30 Structural Ladder Columns)\r\nTwo-lines structural ladder column featuring dual uprights (40mm × 40mm @ 2.0mm 14G) with welded ladder rungs @ 1.5ft c/c for climbing access, light fixture maintenance, and high lateral wind resistance covering 160 FT × 60 FT Arena Structure (22 side columns + 4 West end wall + 4 East front wall columns = 30 Nos; Zone C 25 FT has zero steel structure).","hsn":"7308","qty":30,"unit":"NOS","rate":29500,"amount":885000,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Perimeter Side & Back Ball-Stop Netting System (2.5mm Braided HDPE (45mm Mesh))\r\n2.5mm UV-stabilized high-tenacity HDPE braided netting (45mm square mesh) with heavy 8mm reinforced perimeter border ropes enclosing Zone A Cricket Ground (320 RFT perimeter × 30 FT clear height = 10,080 SFT).","hsn":"5608","qty":10080,"unit":"SQFT","rate":13.5,"amount":136080,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zone A: Overhead Top Ball-Stop Netting System (1.5mm Twisted HDPE (40mm Mesh / 24-Ply))\r\n1.5mm UV-treated lightweight high-tenacity twisted HDPE overhead ball-stop netting (40mm square mesh) designed for minimal sag, supported on 6mm PVC-coated galvanized wire rope tension cable grid (no top steel / zero structural roof purlins required across 100 FT × 60 FT cricket ground).","hsn":"5608","qty":6000,"unit":"SQFT","rate":8.5,"amount":51000,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zone B: Structural Secondary Roof Purlin Grid Framework (Badminton & Amenities Complex Roof)\r\nEngineered structural cold-formed Z-purlins / structural RHS tubular purlins spaced @ 4.5 FT c/c across 60 FT width for 60 FT Badminton & Amenities Complex roof metal sheet fastening (14 purlin lines × 60 FT × 1.125 = 945 RFT).","hsn":"7308","qty":945,"unit":"RFT","rate":65,"amount":61425,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zone B: 0.50mm Pre-Painted Galvalume (PPGL) Corrugated Profile Metal Roofing Sheets (Badminton & Amenities Complex Roof - 100% Rainproof)\r\nTCT 0.50mm high-tensile 550 MPa AZ150 zinc-aluminum alloy coated profile sheet roofing covering the 60 FT × 60 FT Badminton & Amenities Complex Zone (4,140 SQFT with slope factor). 100% all-weather rainproof & hail-resistant top covering including ridge caps, EPDM seal washers & self-drilling fasteners.","hsn":"7210","qty":4320,"unit":"SQFT","rate":58,"amount":250560,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zone B: Heavy-Duty Eaves Gutters & Rainwater Downpipes System (Badminton & Amenities Complex Roof)\r\n0.60mm Galvalume profile rainwater drainage gutters running on both 60 FT eaves lengths (120 RFT) with 110mm PVC storm downpipes for zero water spill.","hsn":"7326","qty":120,"unit":"RFT","rate":120,"amount":14400,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zone B: 0.50mm Pre-Painted Galvalume (PPGL) Corrugated Profile Metal Wall Cladding Sheets (All 4 Sides of Badminton & Amenities Complex)\r\nTCT 0.50mm high-tensile 550 MPa AZ150 zinc-aluminum alloy color-coated corrugated profile side wall sheeting covering all 4 perimeter walls of the Badminton & Amenities Complex (240 RFT perimeter × full 30 FT clear eave height = 7,200 SQFT) for complete windproofing, zero shuttle drift, and 100% all-weather indoor playing environment, including corner flashings, drip trims & weather fasteners.","hsn":"7210","qty":7500,"unit":"SQFT","rate":58,"amount":435000,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zone B: Structural Secondary Wall Girt & Runner Grid Framework (All 4 Sides of Badminton & Amenities Complex)\r\nEngineered structural tubular steel horizontal wall runners / girts mounted @ 5.0 FT c/c across all 4 perimeter walls of the Badminton & Amenities Complex (240 RFT perimeter × 6 horizontal tiers = 1,440 RFT) for rigid corrugated metal side wall sheet fastening and high lateral wind resistance.","hsn":"7308","qty":1440,"unit":"RFT","rate":55,"amount":79200,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zo