 Pipe, 2.0mm (14G))","Column Upright Specification: 2.0mm Wall Thickness (14 Gauge) (35 FT Clear Height)","Horizontal Tie Framework: 6 tiers on enclosed sides (3300 RFT, 165 pipes of 20ft, 14 Gauge)","Bay Spacing: ~15.5ft c/c along practice lane","Ladder Rungs: 828 Nos welded steps/bracing (2.0mm (14G)) spaced @ 1.5ft c/c for climbing inspection & wind rigidity","Open Top configuration (No overhead steel or net)"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Zone 2 (Cricket): Perimeter Ball-Stop Netting System (2.5mm Braided HDPE (45mm Mesh - Recommended Standard))\r\n2.5mm UV-stabilized high-tenacity HDPE braided netting (45mm square mesh) with heavy 8mm reinforced perimeter border ropes enclosing 3 outer perimeter sides of the 90 FT × 50 FT Outdoor Box Cricket Arena up to 30 FT height, reinforced with 8mm border ropes and wire rope suspension.","hsn":"5608","qty":6900,"unit":"SQFT","rate":13.5,"amount":93150,"specs":["Enclosed Net Area: 550 RFT x 35 FT = 6900 SFT (3 sides, incl. overlap)","Net Specification: 2.5mm UV-Stabilized High-Tenacity Braided HDPE (45mm Square Mesh)","Tension Wire Rope: 4675 RFT galvanized wire with turnbuckles & clamps"],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Structural Secondary Roof Purlin Grid Framework\r\nEngineered structural cold-formed Z-purlins / structural RHS tubular purlins spaced @ 4.5 FT c/c across width for corrugated metal sheet fastening.","hsn":"7308","qty":4462.5,"unit":"RFT","rate":65,"amount":290062.5,"specs":["Quantity: 4,463 Running Feet of engineered roof purlins","Spacing: 4.5 FT center-to-center across width","Coating: Anti-corrosion zinc chromate primer & weather-resistant enamel coat"],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"0.50mm Pre-Painted Galvalume (PPGL) Corrugated Profile Metal Roofing Sheets (100% Rainproof)\r\nTCT 0.50mm high-tensile 550 MPa AZ150 zinc-aluminum alloy coated profile sheet roofing. 100% all-weather rainproof & hail-resistant top covering including ridge caps, EPDM seal washers & self-drilling fasteners.","hsn":"7210","qt