 Braided HDPE (45mm Mesh)","twine":"2.5mm UV-Stabilized High-Tenacity Braided HDPE","mesh":"45mm Square Mesh","full_desc":"2.5mm UV-stabilized high-tenacity HDPE braided netting (45mm square mesh) with heavy 8mm reinforced perimeter border ropes","rate_adj":0},"top_net_key":"twisted_1_5mm_35mm","top_net_profile":{"key":"open_top","name":"Open Top (No Overhead Netting)","twine":"N/A","mesh":"N/A","full_desc":"Open top arena without overhead net","is_light":false,"rate_adj":0},"top_net_spec":{"name":"Open Top (No Overhead Netting)","twine":"N/A","mesh":"N/A","desc":"Open-top arena without overhead roof netting","support":"Open Top (Side & Back Nets Only)"},"side_net_sft":5250,"back_net_sft":4200,"perimeter_net_sft":9450,"top_net_sft":0,"total_net_sft":9450,"wire_rope_rft":2520,"turf_type":"infill_turf","has_turf":true,"has_infill":true,"turf_area_sft":8000,"light_masts":8,"lights_count":{"essential":6,"commercial":8,"premium_pro":12}},"excluded_items":[]},"scope_items":[{"title":"1. Civil Ground Base & Compaction","description":"Engineered sub-base preparation including site excavation (6-9 inches), heavy mechanical roller compaction, geotextile anti-weed membrane, 75mm-100mm graded blue metal aggregate (WMM/GSB) and 25mm stone dust leveling layer with 0.5% laser-graded slope.","note":"Provides all-weather playability and prevents surface undulations."},{"title":"2. Sub-Surface & Perimeter Drainage","description":"Engineered drainage system with perforated PVC drain pipes in aggregate trenches or French drain channels along perimeter with catch pits and stormwater gradient connection.","note":"Ensures zero water accumulation even during heavy rainfall."},{"title":"3. Structural MS/GI Cage & Column Framework","description":"Heavy-duty vertical columns (3\"x3\" or 4\"x4\" SHS MS/GI pipes) spaced at engineered 15 ft bays, anchored into 1.5ft x 1.5ft x 3ft deep M20 concrete footings. 4 tiers of horizontal tie purlins running continuously around perimeter. Anti-rust primer + double coat weather-resistant PU finish.","note":"Engineered for high wind load stability and long service life."},{"title":"4. Sports Netting System (Side & Top)","description":"UV-stabilized HDPE braided / Russea™ high-tenacity sports netting (40mm-45mm square mesh). Side/back ball-stop protection up to full court height, plus heavy-duty overhead roof net supported on cross-tension steel wire ropes with turnbuckles and stainless steel D-shackles.","note":"Prevents ball escape and protects lighting fixtures and spectators."},{"title":"5. Artificial Sports Turf System","description":"High-density monofilament sports turf (30mm/40mm/50mm/60mm) with multi-layer reinforced PP + PU backing and drainage perforations. High-purity silica sand and SBR rubber granule infill evenly distributed via mechanical brush. Turf rolls bonded with 30cm seaming tape and two-part polyurethane adhesive.","note":"Meets regulation bounce, shock absorption and player traction standards."},{"title":"6. High-Output Stadium LED Floodlighting","description":"IP66/IP67 rated commercial sports LED floodlights (150W/200W/300W) mounted on structural perimeter columns. Complete with industrial weather-proof distribution board, MCBs, digital timer control, heavy 4-core copper armored cabling, and chemical earthing pit.","note":"Designed for uniform 250-350+ lux illumination for tournament-grade night play."},{"title":"7. Player Entry Gate & Court Accessories","description":"Heavy-duty steel tubular access door (3ft/4ft x 7ft) with cylinder lock, weather-proof hinges and protective padding. Official regulation inlaid court line markings, cricket pitch pad or heavy-duty football goalposts with nets.","note":"Safe and convenient player access."},{"title":"8. Complete Turnkey Installation & Handover","description":"End-to-end execution by certified sports infrastructure team. Includes laser leveling, ultrasonic structural welding checks, turf tensioning, netting rigging, lux level verification, and official handover certification.","note":"Turnkey handover — fully ready to play."}],"created_at":"2026-09-14T05:49:55+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T06:31:40+00:00"},{"id":"EST-202609-033","type":"estimation","date":"2026-09-13","payment_status":"unpaid","advance_amount":0,"balance_amount":837850.8,"payment_mode":"","payment_notes":"","customer_type":"client","sale_unit_mode":"sqft","bill_to":{"name":"Riyaz Mujawar","address":"Navi peth, Solapur - 413001","gstin":"","state":"Maharastra","phone":"9975816231","whatsapp":"9975816231"},"ship_to":{"same_as_bill":1,"name":"","address":"","phone":"","state":""},"po_number":"","po_date":"","delivery_timeline":"","items":[{"description":"Bellin Turf 50mm 12000 Green 4mtr*25mtr 6Rolls","hsn":"570339","qty":6480,"unit":"SQFT","rate":62,"amount":401760,"specs":[],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Bellinturf Artificial Grass - Multisport - 15mm D/L DARK GREEN 1 ROLL","hsn":"570339","qty":540,"unit":"SQFT","rate":75,"amount":40500,"specs":[],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"White Joint Tape 100mtr","hsn":"56031100","qty":250,"unit":"MTR","rate":45,"amount":11250,"specs":[],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Rubber Granules (Waste) 50Kgs","hsn":"40040000","qty":4000,"unit":"KG","rate":35,"amount":140000,"specs":[],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Speb 7 Adhesive 5Ltr 13Kan","hsn":"35069190","qty":65,"unit":"KG","rate":330,"amount":21450,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18},{"description":"Silica Sand","hsn":"250510","qty":14300,"unit":"KG","rate":6.5,"amount":92950,"specs":[],"gst_rate":5},{"description":"Installation Charges with Infill Material","hsn":"9954","qty":6480,"unit":"SQFT","rate":12,"amount":77760,"specs":[],"gst_rate":18}],"subtotal":785670,"discount_type":"percent","discount_percent":0,"discount_flat":0,"discount_amount":0,"taxable_value":785670,"is_gst":true,"gst_mode":"igst","cgst_rate":0,"cgst_amount":0,"sgst_rate":0,"sgst_amount":0,"igst_rate":0,"igst_amount":52180.8,"gst_breakdown":[{"rate":5,"taxable":686460,"igst_rate":5,"igst_amount":3