ject Management: Dedicated project engineer supervision, quality inspection, and test handover.","hsn":"9983","qty":"1","unit":"JOB","rate":"12800","gst_rate":"18","amount":"12800","specs":["Safe transport of heavy pipes, turf rolls, nets, and aggregate to project site"]}]},"scope_items":[{"title":"1. Civil Ground Base & Compaction","description":"Engineered sub-base preparation including site excavation (6-9 inches), heavy mechanical roller compaction, geotextile anti-weed membrane, 75mm-100mm graded blue metal aggregate (WMM/GSB) and 25mm stone dust leveling layer with 0.5% laser-graded slope.","note":"Provides all-weather playability and prevents surface undulations."},{"title":"2. Sub-Surface & Perimeter Drainage","description":"Engineered drainage system with perforated PVC drain pipes in aggregate trenches or French drain channels along perimeter with catch pits and stormwater gradient connection.","note":"Ensures zero water accumulation even during heavy rainfall."},{"title":"3. Structural MS/GI Cage & Column Framework","description":"Heavy-duty vertical columns (3\"x3\" or 4\"x4\" SHS MS/GI pipes) spaced at engineered 15 ft bays, anchored into 1.5ft x 1.5ft x 3ft deep M20 concrete footings. 4 tiers of horizontal tie purlins running continuously around perimeter. Anti-rust primer + double coat weather-resistant PU finish.","note":"Engineered for high wind load stability and long service life."},{"title":"4. Sports Netting System (Side & Top)","description":"UV-stabilized HDPE braided / Russea™ high-tenacity sports netting (40mm-45mm square mesh). Side/back ball-stop protection up to full court height, plus heavy-duty overhead roof net supported on cross-tension steel wire ropes with turnbuckles and stainless steel D-shackles.","note":"Prevents ball escape and protects lighting fixtures and spectators."},{"title":"5. Artificial Sports Turf System","description":"High-density monofilament sports turf (30mm/40mm/50mm/60mm) with multi-layer reinforced PP + PU bac