s."},{"title":"5. Artificial Sports Turf System","description":"High-density monofilament sports turf (30mm/40mm/50mm/60mm) with multi-layer reinforced PP + PU backing and drainage perforations. High-purity silica sand and SBR rubber granule infill evenly distributed via mechanical brush. Turf rolls bonded with 30cm seaming tape and two-part polyurethane adhesive.","note":"Meets regulation bounce, shock absorption and player traction standards."},{"title":"6. High-Output Stadium LED Floodlighting","description":"IP66/IP67 rated commercial sports LED floodlights (150W/200W/300W) mounted on structural perimeter columns. Complete with industrial weather-proof distribution board, MCBs, digital timer control, heavy 4-core copper armored cabling, and chemical earthing pit.","note":"Designed for uniform 250-350+ lux illumination for tournament-grade night play."},{"title":"7. Player Entry Gate & Court Accessories","description":"Heavy-duty steel tubular access door (3ft/4ft x 7ft) with cylinder lock, weather-proof hinges and protective padding. Official regulation inlaid court line markings, cricket pitch pad or heavy-duty football goalposts with nets.","note":"Safe and convenient player access."},{"title":"8. Complete Turnkey Installation & Handover","description":"End-to-end execution by certified sports infrastructure team. Includes laser leveling, ultrasonic structural welding checks, turf tensioning, netting rigging, lux level verification, and official handover certification.","note":"Turnkey handover — fully ready to play."}],"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:57:57+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:58:27+00:00","tax_amount":226238.38,"total":2037135.88},{"id":"EST-202609-025","type":"estimation","date":"2026-09-09","customer_type":"client","sale_unit_mode":"sqft","bill_to":{"name":"Riyaz Mujawar","address":"Navi peth, Solapur - 413001","gstin":"","state":"Maharastra"},"items":[{"description":"Civil Ground Preparation & Base Slab (4\" Heavy RCC Tremix Bed)\r\n4-Inch M20/M